{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hordeguard</strong>\u00a0blends tower defense, action-strategy, and RPG elements in a Viking-inspired world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/b4f792c0678b0be5a87ac1fdfe59f40d.poster.avif?t=1758810536\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/b4f792c0678b0be5a87ac1fdfe59f40d.webm?t=1758810536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/b4f792c0678b0be5a87ac1fdfe59f40d.mp4?t=1758810536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tower defense</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentless waves of monsters besiege your village. Build towers, raise palisades, set barricades, and lay traps to defend your settlement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop down trees, mine stone, and construct various buildings to manage resources, boost village morale, recruit your warband, craft traps, or gain a God Blessing.\u00a0Build Barracks and an Archery to recruit members for your warband. Command them to defend the village or help you clear the land of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/3b86228a0f7ec054a594c7eb1e33e184.poster.avif?t=1758810536\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/3b86228a0f7ec054a594c7eb1e33e184.webm?t=1758810536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/3b86228a0f7ec054a594c7eb1e33e184.mp4?t=1758810536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your Viking hero, explore and clear areas of monsters. Collect gems, level up your character with various abilities, and take on side quests for extra rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the clock ticking, every decision counts \u2013 strategize quickly and act swiftly to ensure the survival of your village. Will you gather more resources, repair damaged towers, build new defenses, heal your wounds, or lead your warband to destroy a summoning portal before the next wave begins? The fate of your village depends on your choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with a friend in local co-op mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a tiny team of two indie developers based in Slovakia, working hard to bring our vision to life.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618000?t=1758810536","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618000?t=1758810536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/99d9c00bd4c6b5a2174a0b9762747de0859886be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758810536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/99d9c00bd4c6b5a2174a0b9762747de0859886be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758810536","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hordeguard</strong>\u00a0blends tower defense, action-strategy, and RPG elements in a Viking-inspired world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/b4f792c0678b0be5a87ac1fdfe59f40d.poster.avif?t=1758810536\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/b4f792c0678b0be5a87ac1fdfe59f40d.webm?t=1758810536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/b4f792c0678b0be5a87ac1fdfe59f40d.mp4?t=1758810536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tower defense</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentless waves of monsters besiege your village. Build towers, raise palisades, set barricades, and lay traps to defend your settlement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop down trees, mine stone, and construct various buildings to manage resources, boost village morale, recruit your warband, craft traps, or gain a God Blessing.\u00a0Build Barracks and an Archery to recruit members for your warband. Command them to defend the village or help you clear the land of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/3b86228a0f7ec054a594c7eb1e33e184.poster.avif?t=1758810536\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/3b86228a0f7ec054a594c7eb1e33e184.webm?t=1758810536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/3b86228a0f7ec054a594c7eb1e33e184.mp4?t=1758810536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your Viking hero, explore and clear areas of monsters. Collect gems, level up your character with various abilities, and take on side quests for extra rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the clock ticking, every decision counts \u2013 strategize quickly and act swiftly to ensure the survival of your village. Will you gather more resources, repair damaged towers, build new defenses, heal your wounds, or lead your warband to destroy a summoning portal before the next wave begins? The fate of your village depends on your choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with a friend in local co-op mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a tiny team of two indie developers based in Slovakia, working hard to bring our vision to life.</p>","developers":["Black Deer Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/ace9245390420400167dec6a1b2217af0d082ed1/header.jpg?t=1758810536","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://vi